<title>SPAIN: Spain will be in EMU first wave - Aznar.</title>
<headline>Spain will be in EMU first wave - Aznar.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar reiterated on Wednesday the government's intention to join European economic and monetary union (EMU) from the start.</p>
<p>&quot;I like to reiterate the clear determination of the Spanish government to be part of EMU from the beginning,&quot; he told reporters after a seminar in Madrid.</p>
<p>He added Spain will meet convergence criteria as required and as scheduled under the terms of the Maastricht Treaty.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
